      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشِيمَةٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِرْس</span>; (S, TA;) i. e. (TA) the <i>place
of,</i> (K, TA,) or [<i>membrane that encloses,</i> or <i>forms
the</i>] <i>covering of,</i> (Msb,) <i>the fœtus</i> (Msb, K, TA)
<i>of a human being:</i> (Msb: [see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِرْسٌ</span>:]) originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْيِمَةٌ</span>: (S, Msb:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشَايِمُ</span> (S, K) and [coll.
gen. n.] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشِيمٌ</span></b> . (IB, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلًى</span>.]

